# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SAFETY: this git repository is rooted at the Windows home folder, but ONLY the
# PTC-Loyalty app is meant to be tracked. Ignore everything at the root, then
# explicitly re-allow the app folder. This prevents a stray `git add -A` from
# ever staging home secrets (.ssh, NTUSER.DAT, .bash_history, real .env, etc.).
#
# NOTE: The Next.js app lives in the PTC-Loyalty/ subfolder. On Vercel, set the
# project's Root Directory to "PTC-Loyalty" so it finds package.json.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*
!/.gitignore
!/PTC-Loyalty/
